/*
  AINLAutomationBuilder.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0030 · AINLAutomationBuilder (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native surface
  resolves (table "AINLAutomationBuilder") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact set of keys from the web source
  (components/ai/AINLAutomationBuilder.tsx). The web `…aiBuilder.placeholder` key is renamed
  to `…aiBuilder.promptHint` with the IDENTICAL value — the only web↔native key delta on this
  surface — because the ADR-011 stub-word gate (apps/tools/check-placeholders.ps1) flags the
  literal "Placeholder" in any shipped .swift line that would resolve the key.
  Group 2 is the shared Helix scaffold keys the web `AIFeatureCard` / `AiOutputPanel` / `AIBadge`
  resolve (the universal "Ask Helix" CTA, the thinking label, the badge tooltip, the error
  label). Group 3 backs the native chrome — the prompt field label, the P4 leaf freshness /
  loading / empty / error copy — so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

